**Game Description:**

Dungeon Quest is a 2D text-based adventure game where the player navigates a character through a dungeon, interacts with enemies, and collects treasure. The game is set in a fantasy world where the player must explore the dungeon, fight off monsters, and collect gold and items to increase their chances of survival.

