# Dungeon Quest
================================

Dungeon Quest is a 2D text-based adventure game where the player navigates a character through a dungeon, interacts with enemies, and collects treasure.

## Game Mechanics
----------------

* The game will have a grid-based map, where the player can move up, down, left, or right using the 'w', 'a','s', and 'd' keys.
* The player will start with a health of 100 and a small inventory.
* The player will encounter enemies that will attack the player if they are in the same location.
* The player can collect gold and items from defeated enemies and chests.
* The player can use items to heal themselves or increase their health.
* The game will have a win condition, such as reaching a certain treasure location or collecting a set amount of gold.

## Setup
--------

To play the game, simply run the game.py file.

