# Game Design Document

## Game Title: Treasure Hunter

## Overview
Treasure Hunter is a simple text-based adventure game where the player takes on the role of an archaeologist searching for hidden treasures. The game will feature a simple interface, a grid-based map, and basic puzzle-solving mechanics.

## Game Mechanics

* The game will take place in a 10x10 grid, with some cells containing treasures, obstacles, or nothing.
* The player will start at a random location on the grid and will have to navigate to the treasure by moving up, down, left, or right.
* The player will have a limited number of moves before the game ends.
* The player can see the grid layout, but not the exact location of the treasure.
* The game will feature basic puzzle mechanics, such as finding a key to unlock a chest or avoiding obstacles.

