# Island Survival Game

## Game Description
Island Survival is a simple text-based game where the player is stranded on a deserted island after a shipwreck. The player must manage resources, build shelter, and find food to survive. The game will end after 10 days, and the player's goal is to survive as long as possible.

## Installation
To run the game, you need to have Python 3.8 or higher installed on your system. Clone the repository using the following command:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/island-survival.git
```

## Features
- Text-based game
- Resource management
- Building shelter
- Finding food
- Surviving for as long as possible

## Run the Game
To run the game, navigate to the project directory and execute the following command:

```bash
python game.py
```
